Urgency: medium
Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Description:
 linuxmuster-tools7 - Tools for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-tools7 (7.4.20) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [security] [linbo] get_onboot_command() never returns the
     "linbo:<password>" entry written by linbo-remote -p before an
     upload: it is the LINBO rsync password in clear. See
     linuxmuster-api#51, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] Deleting an image removes its whole directory, backups,
     differential image and any file added by hand included, instead of
     its known files only, which left the directory behind. An image
     whose .info is missing or incomplete can be deleted too. The path is
     checked to be a directory below /srv/linbo before removal. Fix #39,
     reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] New last_start(workstation), the last OS start of a client
     and the name of the OS, read from its <hostname>_linbo.log, or from
     the last rotated .1.gz if the current log holds none.
     last_sync_all() gets a laststart parameter filling lastStart for
     each host.
   * [linbo] New LinboBootLogs.latest_remote_log(), the log of the last
     linbo-remote run of a host: linuxmuster-linbo7 7.4.18 writes one log
     per run, the former <hostname>.linbo-remote is still read as a
     fallback.
   * [linbo] LinboRemote accepts the linbo-remote command
     image_name:<name> of linuxmuster-linbo7 7.4.21, creating or uploading
     an image under a new name. It refuses it, as linbo-remote does,
     without a following create_image/upload_image and with a qdiff
     command. Fix #46, reported by @HappyBasher.
   * [linbo] A missing SyncEnabled, NewEnabled or StartEnabled in a
     start.conf is read as yes, as LINBO does, instead of raising a
     KeyError.
   * [devices] The validator reports a LINBO group containing '__'
     (group.reserved_separator): LINBO names the group of a non default
     school <school>__<group>.
   * [samba_util] last_login() gives the hostname of each login, resolved
     from the devices.csv of all schools, and leaves out the
     administrator account.
   * [lmnconfig] New load_shares(), reading again the shares and their
     DFS targets, so far only read at import. get_user_quotas() calls it
     once when a share is not found, e.g. after it was moved to a
     fileserver while linuxmuster-api was running.
   * [quotas] list_user_files() no longer matches a directory whose name
     only starts with the one looked for.
   * [print] LatexRenderer raises UnknownTemplateTypeError for a template
     type it does not know, instead of failing later on an undefined
     output file.
